":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620625005:1":{"text":"まあ、元気だよ。特に変わったことはないかな。","source_cn":"我挺好的，一如既往地混日子。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x941ECE21567E12B9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"まあ、元気だよ。特に変わったことはないかな。","female":"まあ、元気だよ。特に変わったことはないかな。","variant_male_record_index":"213910","variant_female_record_index":"213911","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620625006:0":{"text":"でもローランは、ちゃんと食べて寝ての生活ができるようになったぞ。","source_cn":"至于洛兰，至少现在能按时吃饭睡觉了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6C3F199F4611AE2C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"でもローランは、ちゃんと食べて寝ての生活ができるようになったぞ。","female":"でもローランは、ちゃんと食べて寝ての生活ができるようになったぞ。","variant_male_record_index":"213912","variant_female_record_index":"213913","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620625007:0":{"text":"健康だけは気を付けようと思ったんです。もし僕が倒れて、先生が責任を感じるといけないので。","source_cn":"影响健康的事我肯定不会再做了。毕竟学生要是出了状况，老...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF92CCF7301B08F8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1620625008:0":{"text":"はぁ……お前、ほんと変わったよな。今は教育学にどっぷりで、口を開けば教師がどうのこうのって……","source_cn":"呼……这小子现在变了，从之前的学术转移到教育学了，满嘴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3BCBBCB17423CAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1